{
  "title": "2 Elementary - Calling In Sick",
  "audio": "./assets/englishpod_B0002pb.mp3",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello English learners, welcome to EnglishPod, my name is Marco.",
      "trans": "你好，英语学习者，欢迎来到英语pod。我的名字是马克。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我是艾瑞克。",
      "start": 5.4,
      "end": 6.6000000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "And today we're going to be bringing you a very useful lesson about being sick.",
      "trans": "今天我们将向您介绍一个非常有用的关于生病的实用技巧。",
      "start": 6.6000000000000005,
      "end": 11.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, we're going to learn how to tell your boss that you can't go to work because you're sick.",
      "trans": "是的，我们决定告诉你的老板你不能去上班，因为你生病了。",
      "start": 11.4,
      "end": 19.400000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly, this is really important because we all get sick and sometimes you just can't go to work.",
      "trans": "是的，这非常重要，因为我们每个人都生病过，有时候你根本无法工作。",
      "start": 19.400000000000002,
      "end": 25.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, or maybe sometimes you just don't want to go to work.",
      "trans": "是的，或者有时候你可能不想去上班。",
      "start": 25.0,
      "end": 28.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly, maybe you're lying.",
      "trans": "是的，也许你是在说谎。",
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 29.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 29.6,
      "end": 30.6
    },
    {
      "text": "But we're going to be teaching you how to do it anyways.",
      "trans": "但是我们还是决定教你如何做呢。",
      "start": 30.6,
      "end": 32.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So before we start with our dialogue, let's take a look at vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 32.4,
      "end": 37.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 39.0
    },
    {
      "text": "In this vocabulary preview, we have two words for you.",
      "trans": "在这一词汇预览中，我们有两个词给你。",
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 43.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The first one is quite ill.",
      "trans": "第一个是不太好的。",
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 45.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Quite ill.",
      "trans": "很笨。",
      "start": 45.6,
      "end": 46.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Quite ill.",
      "trans": "很笨。",
      "start": 46.8,
      "end": 48.400000000000006
    },
    {
      "text": "So quite ill.",
      "trans": "英语：所以挺笨。",
      "start": 48.400000000000006,
      "end": 50.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Very sick.",
      "trans": "很不舒服。",
