      "start": 54.400000000000006,
      "end": 55.400000000000006
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 55.400000000000006,
      "end": 56.400000000000006
    },
    {
      "text": "Sick.",
      "trans": "生病。",
      "start": 56.4,
      "end": 57.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So they both mean the same thing.",
      "trans": "所以他们都意味着同样的意思。",
      "start": 57.4,
      "end": 59.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No difference.",
