      "start": 64.4,
      "end": 65.4
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，我将这句话翻译成中文：",
      "start": 65.4,
      "end": 66.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's take a look at our second word.",
