      "end": 81.4
    },
    {
      "text": "So it's stronger.",
      "trans": "所以它更强。",
      "start": 81.4,
      "end": 82.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 82.4,
      "end": 83.4
    },
    {
      "text": "It's also called influenza.",
      "trans": "英语：它也被称为流感。",
      "start": 83.4,
      "end": 86.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Unfluenza, exactly.",
      "trans": "英语：流感，正好。",
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 88.12
    },
    {
      "text": "So the flu.",
      "trans": "英语：所以这个流感。",
      "start": 88.12,
      "end": 89.60000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so let's listen to our dialogue.",
      "trans": "好的，现在让我们听我们的对话。",
      "start": 89.60000000000001,
      "end": 91.80000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "What's going to happen here today?",
      "trans": "今天发生什么事？",
      "start": 91.80000000000001,
      "end": 93.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, we're going to listen as Julie calls her boss to tell him she's sick.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，我们将听取乔尔小姐的上司打电话通知她生病。",
      "start": 93.12,
      "end": 98.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, but is she really sick?",
      "trans": "英语：一切好，但她真的生病了。",
      "start": 98.24000000000001,
      "end": 100.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "trans": "我不会。",
      "start": 100.64000000000001,
      "end": 101.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's find out.",
      "trans": "让我们找找。",
      "start": 101.64000000000001,
      "end": 102.64000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I have a headache.",
      "trans": "我有头痛。",
      "start": 113.4,
      "end": 117.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So throat.",
      "trans": "所以喉咙。",
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 118.60000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Running nose.",
      "trans": "运行的鼻涕。",
      "start": 118.60000000000001,
      "end": 119.60000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm feeling slightly feverish.",
      "trans": "我有点发热。",
      "start": 119.60000000000001,
      "end": 121.2
    },
    {
      "text": "See, so you're calling in sick.",
      "trans": "英语：看，你是不是在生病？",
      "start": 121.2,
      "end": 124.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, I was hoping to take the day off to recover.",
      "trans": "是的，我希望能今天好好休息，以便恢复。",
      "start": 124.0,
      "end": 128.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure you're going to be able to recover.",
      "trans": "我保证你能恢复。",
      "start": 128.88,
      "end": 132.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to get back to you.",
      "trans": "我将尽快回复你。",
      "start": 132.56,
      "end": 134.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to get back to you.",
      "trans": "我将回到你这里。",
      "start": 134.4,
      "end": 136.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to get back to you.",
      "trans": "我将尽快回复你。",
      "start": 136.4,
      "end": 138.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to get back to you.",
      "trans": "我将回到你这里。",
      "start": 138.4,
      "end": 140.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to get back to you.",
      "trans": "我将尽快回复你。",
