      "start": 143.4,
      "end": 144.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Try and get some rest.",
      "trans": "英语：试试和休息一下。",
      "start": 144.4,
      "end": 148.4
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, so Julie didn't really seem to be sick, huh?",
      "trans": "英语：所有好，苏莉莉没有真的看起来不舒服吧？",
      "start": 148.4,
      "end": 155.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I don't know.",
      "trans": "嗯，我不太明白。",
      "start": 155.88,
      "end": 157.4
    },
    {
      "text": "That cough was just a little too much.",
