    {
      "text": "Language takeaway.",
      "trans": "语言总结。",
      "start": 168.08,
      "end": 169.92000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "We have five words for you here.",
      "trans": "我们这里有五个词给你。",
      "start": 169.92,
      "end": 172.16
    },
    {
      "text": "And these are all great words to describe a sickness, right?",
      "trans": "是的，这些都是描述疾病的好词。",
      "start": 172.16,
      "end": 175.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Mm-hmm.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯。",
      "start": 175.48,
      "end": 176.48
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, the first one, headache.",
      "trans": "好的，第一个，头疼。",
      "start": 176.48,
      "end": 178.27999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Headache.",
      "trans": "头疼。",
      "start": 178.27999999999997,
      "end": 179.27999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Headache.",
      "trans": "头疼。",
      "start": 179.27999999999997,
