      "start": 205.96,
      "end": 208.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Hurting.",
      "trans": "英语：Hurt.",
      "start": 208.04000000000002,
      "end": 209.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "It hurts, right?",
      "trans": "是的，它痛。",
      "start": 209.04000000000002,
      "end": 210.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 210.04000000000002,
      "end": 211.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And your throat is...",
