    {
      "text": "So take the day off means to not go to work on that day.",
      "trans": "所以，今天不上班意味着不去工作。",
      "start": 535.56,
      "end": 538.36
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 538.36,
      "end": 539.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen to our dialogue again now and then we'll come back and talk a little bit",
      "trans": "让我们再听一遍我们的对话，然后我们再聊点小的。",
      "start": 539.36,
      "end": 543.68
    },
    {
      "text": "more.",
      "trans": "更多。",
      "start": 543.68,
      "end": 544.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, Daniel speaking.",
      "trans": "你好，丹尼尔在讲话。",
      "start": 544.68,
      "end": 551.9599999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "How may help you?",
      "trans": "你好吗？",
      "start": 551.9599999999999,
      "end": 553.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Daniel.",
      "trans": "你好，丹尼尔。",
      "start": 553.4,
      "end": 554.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Julie here.",
      "trans": "在这里，杰里。",
      "start": 554.4,
      "end": 555.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Julie.",
      "trans": "你好，尤里。",
      "start": 555.4,
      "end": 556.4
    },
    {
      "text": "How are you?",
      "trans": "你好吗？",
      "start": 556.4,
      "end": 557.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Actually, I'm feeling quite ill today.",
      "trans": "实际上，我今天感觉有点不舒服。",
      "start": 557.4,
      "end": 562.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我听到有事了。",
      "start": 562.0,
      "end": 564.28
    },
    {
      "text": "What's wrong?",
      "trans": "对不起，我无法直接翻译中文到另一种语言。不过，我可以尝试用英文来回答这个问题。",
      "start": 564.28,
      "end": 565.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I'm coming down with the flu.",
      "trans": "我感觉我可能得了流感。",
      "start": 565.28,
      "end": 568.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I have a headache, sore throat, a runny nose.",
      "trans": "我头疼，喉咙痛，流鼻涕。",
      "start": 568.04,
      "end": 573.0
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm feeling slightly feverish.",
      "trans": "我有点发烧。",
      "start": 573.0,
      "end": 575.24
    },
    {
      "text": "See, so you're calling in sick.",
      "trans": "英语：看，所以你是在请病假。",
      "start": 575.24,
      "end": 578.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 578.08,
      "end": 579.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I was hoping to take the day off to recover.",
      "trans": "我希望能今天好好休息，以便恢复。",
      "start": 579.08,
      "end": 582.48
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, then.",
      "trans": "好的，那么。",
      "start": 582.48,
      "end": 583.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Try and get some rest.",
      "trans": "英语：试着休息一下。",
      "start": 583.48,
      "end": 585.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, Marco, have you ever done what Julie did?",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，玛酷，你有没有做过像莉莉那样干的？",
      "start": 591.92,
      "end": 595.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you ever call your boss to say you're sick when you're not really?",
      "trans": "英语：你曾没有真正告诉你老板你生病过吗？",
      "start": 595.92,
      "end": 599.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, of course.",
      "trans": "是的，当然。",
      "start": 599.92,
      "end": 600.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, sometimes you just don't feel very well, but you're not really sick.",
      "trans": "英语：我指的是，有时候你可能感觉不怎么舒服，但并不算严重。",
      "start": 600.68,
      "end": 604.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You just don't feel like going to work.",
      "trans": "你刚才没有感觉要出门。",
      "start": 604.52,
      "end": 606.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 606.0799999999999,
      "end": 607.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Or sometimes you have something to do, right?",
      "trans": "英语：或者有时候你有事情要干，对吗？",
      "start": 607.0799999999999,
      "end": 609.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 609.64,
      "end": 610.64
    },
    {
      "text": "You know what?",
      "trans": "你明白吗？",
      "start": 610.64,
      "end": 611.64
    },
    {
      "text": "We call those in Canada.",
      "trans": "我们把这些放在加拿大的。",
      "start": 611.64,
      "end": 612.8
    },
    {
      "text": "We call them personal days.",
      "trans": "我们称它们个人日。",
      "start": 612.8,
      "end": 614.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Personal days.",
      "trans": "个人时间。",
      "start": 614.8,
      "end": 615.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 615.8,
      "end": 616.8
    },
    {
      "text": "So you say, oh, I'm going to take a personal day.",
      "trans": "英语：所以你说，哦，我要一天假。",
      "start": 616.8,
      "end": 618.7199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to call in sick, but then go shopping.",
      "trans": "我打算请假，但然后去购物。",
      "start": 618.7199999999999,
      "end": 622.8
    },
    {
      "text": "We used to do that a lot because, for example, soccer games are such a big deal.",
      "trans": "我们过去常常这样做，因为比如足球比赛这么重要。",
      "start": 622.8,
      "end": 626.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，对了。",
      "start": 626.4,
      "end": 627.4
    },
    {
      "text": "And sometimes you would have a soccer match between Brazil and it would be maybe at 10",
      "trans": "有时你会有一场巴西和它之间的足球比赛，可能在10点。",
      "start": 627.4,
      "end": 633.72
    },
    {
      "text": "a.m. or 11 a.m.",
      "trans": "早上八点或者十一点。",
      "start": 633.72,
      "end": 635.0
    },
    {
      "text": "So everyone would call in sick on that day.",
      "trans": "所以那天大家都决定请假了。",
      "start": 635.0,
      "end": 637.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 637.52,
      "end": 638.52
    },
    {
      "text": "The boss at least could plan that he would have an empty office.",
      "trans": "英语：至少可以推测他将有一个空办公室。",
      "start": 638.52,
      "end": 640.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 640.72,
      "end": 641.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Or sometimes you would take half the day off.",
      "trans": "英语：或者有时候你会把一半的天假给掉了。",
      "start": 641.72,
      "end": 643.92
    },
    {
      "text": "So you would just go, you say, well, I'm not going to make it in the morning, but I'll",
      "trans": "所以你只会按照我说的去做，你说得对，我不会在早上做出任何决定，但我会尽力。",
      "start": 643.92,
      "end": 647.1999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "come in the afternoon.",
      "trans": "下午到来。",
      "start": 647.1999999999999,
      "end": 648.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So you would recover very quickly.",
      "trans": "所以你很快就能恢复了。",
      "start": 648.56,
      "end": 650.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 650.72,
      "end": 651.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm feeling a little bit sick, but I'm going to be better in the afternoon.",
      "trans": "英语：我感觉有点不舒服，但下午我会好起来的。",
      "start": 651.72,
      "end": 655.56
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "trans": "好的，以下是“所有好”的翻译：",
      "start": 655.56,
      "end": 656.56
    },
    {
      "text": "So well, if you have any questions or comments, please come to our website.",
      "trans": "英语：所以很好，如果你有任何问题或评论，请来我们的网站。",
      "start": 656.56,
      "end": 660.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "And if you have any calling in sick stories, please let us know.",
      "trans": "如果您在生病故事中有任何请求，请告知我们。",
      "start": 660.4799999999999,
      "end": 663.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 663.88,
      "end": 664.88
    },
    {
      "text": "You can visit us at EnglishPod.com.",
      "trans": "你可以访问我们的英文网站。",
      "start": 664.88,
      "end": 667.1199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "And Marco and I are always there to answer your questions.",
      "trans": "和马科斯和我总是在这里回答你的问题。",
      "start": 667.1199999999999,
      "end": 670.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, folks.",
      "trans": "好的，朋友们。",
      "start": 670.4799999999999,
      "end": 671.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So we'll see you next time.",
      "trans": "所以我们会再次见到你的。",
      "start": 671.4799999999999,
      "end": 672.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for listening.",
      "trans": "谢谢你的聆听。",
      "start": 672.4799999999999,
      "end": 673.4799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
      "start": 673.4799999999999,
      "end": 674.4799999999999
    }
  ]
}